:0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Paste the following into getpsalm.org. It thinks everything is fine (except it thinks all the classes aren't used--maybe another bug?)\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\nclass BaseClass {\r\n    public function foo(): int {\r\n        return 3; \r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nabstract class Child extends BaseClass {\r\n    abstract public function foo(): int;\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass GrandChild extends Child {\r\n    public function foo(): int {\r\n        return 4; \r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n$c = new GrandChild();\r\necho $c->foo();\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, if you tried to actually run this, PHP would throw a fatal error:\r\n\r\n```\r\nPHP Fatal error:  Cannot make non abstract method BaseClass::foo() abstract in class Child\r\n```\r\n\r\nPsalm should catch this.","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vim